type: dataset
title: "Playbook-RAG evaluation data"
abstract: >-
  The evaluation test set and the anonymized source documents it was written
  from, released with the Playbook-RAG system demonstration: nine HR handbook
  documents on external workers, 122 evaluation queries with gold labels, and
  the knowledge map built from them.
